  [1mFolder pattern[m  naming.pattern                                                
  How grove names a new worktree's folder. Session names always use             
  {project}-{name}.                                                             
  ⚠ This project has 2 worktrees besides root. Changing this does not rename    
    their folders. Grove will stop recognizing them by their short names.       
                                                                                
   Value    [1m{project}-{name}[m                                                    
